{"name": "Eternal Bonds", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eternal Bonds is a puzzle platformer where you switch between the perspectives of two characters to solve puzzles in a spaceship. Can you and your unlikely duo escape the spaceship, or will you be stuck puzzling forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/8e422a4d878d55bfaaf284aa5a43b507.avif?t=1771344087\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/639a2e708fe7abbeea10a20975985041.poster.avif?t=1771344087\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/639a2e708fe7abbeea10a20975985041.webm?t=1771344087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/639a2e708fe7abbeea10a20975985041.mp4?t=1771344087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small single-player game (game length depends on how smart you are)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles by switching between the perspectives of two characters  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as an astronaut and his robot each stuck in a different part of a deserted spaceship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flip levers, push buttons, use portals and much more to reach the exit doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an exciting story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/62741dc866c7cb0de4b34238be381841.avif?t=1771344087\" width=\"600\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><table><tr><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/f603d9bf8d46d9f7276b50dafa092134.poster.avif?t=1771344087\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/f603d9bf8d46d9f7276b50dafa092134.webm?t=1771344087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/f603d9bf8d46d9f7276b50dafa092134.mp4?t=1771344087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/97abacc37de7881b33c82c44896a4335.poster.avif?t=1771344087\" width=\"300\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/97abacc37de7881b33c82c44896a4335.webm?t=1771344087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3039320/extras/97abacc37de7881b33c82c44896a4335.mp4?t=1771344087\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></td></tr></table><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made by Castical. Follow the development on YouTube! </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Solve puzzles by switching between the perspective of an astronaut and their robot. Flip levers to deactivate lasers